---
title: "supplyTokens (LegionFixedPriceSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_auth: check caller is projectAdmin
    q_check_auth --> q_revert_auth: not projectAdmin
    q_revert_auth --> [*]: revert Unauthorized
    q_check_auth --> q_check_published: authorized
    q_check_published --> q_check_supplied: results published
    q_check_published --> q_revert_published: results not published
    q_revert_published --> [*]: revert ResultsNotPublished
    q_check_supplied --> q_calc_total: tokensSupplied == false
    q_check_supplied --> q_revert_supplied: already supplied
    q_revert_supplied --> [*]: revert AlreadySupplied
    q_calc_total --> q_transfer: totalRequired = totalTokensAllocated + legionTokenFee + referrerTokenFee
    q_transfer --> q_set_flag: transferFrom(projectAdmin, address(this), totalRequired)
    q_set_flag --> [*]: tokensSupplied = true, emit TokensSupplied

    note right of q_calc_total
        INV-001: tokens can only be supplied once
        INV-002: results must be published before token supply
        INV-003: total supply includes allocation + fees
        INV-004: projectAdmin must have approved sufficient allowance
    end note
